sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as OrderServlet
  participant SV as OrderService
  participant D as OrderDAO
  participant DB as H2 Database
  B->>S: POST checkout
  S->>SV: validate session and cart
  SV->>D: create order and order items
  D->>DB: PreparedStatement transaction
  DB-->>D: commit / generated order id
  D-->>SV: order result
  SV-->>S: success response
  S-->>B: confirmation page / JSON
